  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-39-59">みなとの海は</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-59-88">みどりのびろうど</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-88-117">テーブル掛のやうな</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-117-145">白い船がはいる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-145-168">汽笛はふくれて</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-168-197">みなとにあふれる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-197-220">みんなデツキで</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-220-248">こちらをみてる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-248-271">空からひらりと</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-271-297">ハンケチ落ちた</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-297-320">ちがふあれだよ</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-320-341">白いかもめよ</seg></p>
    </body>
